class_name PixelFont
extends RefCounted

## ===========================================================================
## THE MENU'S OWN LETTERING — scripts/PixelFont.gd
##
## A hand-cut bitmap alphabet, 7 x 11, drawn the way a Lombardic capital is
## drawn: two-pixel stems, wedge feet, squared bowls. Uppercase only, because
## a chapter initial has no lowercase and neither does a title card.
##
## Nothing here is a font resource. render() paints the string into an Image
## at whole-number scale — every letter pixel becomes an N x N block — so the
## result is crisp at any size with no filtering, no import step and no .ttf
## in the repo. The 1 px outline is a dilate of the glyph mask, which is what
## keeps the words legible over the backdrop's bright sky.
##
## Names no other class on purpose (see EditorMode.gd for why).
## ===========================================================================

